00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:31.700
- Look at that sexy little number.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.863
I love that shirt.

00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:36.620
- Wow.
- So what was that?

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.591
Where were you?

00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:38.424
Do you remember?

00:00:38.424 --> 00:00:41.090
- That was in Australia on this thing

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.250
called New Faces.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.240
- Okay.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.200
- I think I was 15 or something.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.760
I said I was 16 to get on the show

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.790
but I think I was 15.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.310
- Okay. So, liar right off the bat.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:51.380
Okay.
- I lied, yeah.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.270
Exactly.
- It's like an actor.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.900
- You're usually lying
to sneak into clubs.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.770
I was lying to sneak into
talent singing competitions.

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:57.760
- I love that though.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:58.593
I just think it's cool.

00:00:58.593 --> 00:00:59.480
I didn't know that about you.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.980
And then you've been helping people,

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.240
