through competitions.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.240
So I think that's really cool.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.073
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

00:01:04.073 --> 00:01:05.480
- Well, I know what it's
like to be crucified

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.263
in front of a lot of people.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.700
So I try not to do that to anybody.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.500
- No, constructive
criticism, always helpful.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:13.333
- Constructive is good, yes.

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:15.130
- Were your parents supportive on that?

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.380
I know a lot of people...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.770
Like when I told my mom I wanted to sing,

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:19.657
she was like "Oh, so do a lot of people"

00:01:19.657 --> 00:01:20.560
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.600
- You know, somebody said criticism

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.070
is a sandwich best served
between two layers of praise.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:26.903
- Oh.

00:01:26.903 --> 00:01:28.310
- That's a good way to do it.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:29.187
- I like to sandwich.
- Because it's like

00:01:29.187 --> 00:01:30.920
"I like blah, blah, blum...

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.327
This is what you could work on.

00:01:32.327 --> 00:01:34.120
But this part is really good as well."

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:35.760
Instead of like that's a nice combination

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.160
I think to feel motivated.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.310
- Oh, wow. That's good.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:40.310
I'm gonna steal that

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:41.830
if you're okay with that?
- Have it, yes.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.150
- Yeah, and then I'm
gonna say it was mine.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:45.310
So wait, you're on the road again.

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:46.930
And everybody is so excited
to get back out on the road.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.930
I know, especially a lot of Nashvillians.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:50.160
A lot of musicians live there

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.100
and have been out of work forever.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:52.093
So everybody's so excited.
- I'm road crew, too.

00:01:52.093 --> 00:01:53.450
- Road crew. That's what I mean.

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:54.950
Everybody has been out of work.

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.360
And so it's called the
Speed of Now World Tour.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.320
And where are some of your favorite play?

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.180
Where are you excited to play?

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.710
- You're so good at this, Kelly.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:02.697
I'm so glad you have a show.
- Oh, I like talking.

00:02:02.697 --> 00:02:04.630
- And you do this so well.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.473
- Thank you.
- It's really good.

00:02:06.473 --> 00:02:07.533
(audience cheers)

00:02:07.533 --> 00:02:08.593
- I like talking.

00:02:08.593 --> 00:02:10.530
- It's great. You were born to do it.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.830
- Oh, I was born to talk.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.240
I actually got in trouble
for it in high school.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.923
So, neener neener, joke's on you!

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.250
But everyone's excited
to get back out there

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.120
and I know a lot of people
have been hurting financially.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.630
Just excited, but also artistically,

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:24.300
it's fun to get out there
and be in front of the crowd.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.844
Cause now, we have a crowd
back here when I'm performing

00:02:26.844 --> 00:02:28.693
and it's different.
(audience cheers)

00:02:28.693 --> 00:02:30.594
It's like a different vibe

00:02:30.594 --> 00:02:33.660
than how we've had to have
done it for the last two years.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.070
- Yeah, well I mean, for
me it's crucial to have

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.500
the crowd is 50 percent
of the whole experience.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.400
Otherwise, it's just one long soundcheck.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.233
- Yeah.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:43.560
- It's not even a gig.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.570
It's just like, "Where's the people?"

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.450
So I feel like I've been
in rehearsal for a year

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.230
and I'm ready to actually play some shows.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.330
- Are there any places
you really love playing?

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:54.600
Like, any places in the
US. that you're like...

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.190
There are always pockets that I love.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:59.000
Like that are like really
good audiences for me.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.710
- Honestly, so many
places are consistent now.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:02.543
- Oh, good.

00:03:02.543 --> 00:03:03.528
- There was times when it was like

00:03:03.528 --> 00:03:06.630
this area was really good and
we still gotta work down here

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:07.540
and everything, but now,

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.340
everything's starting to
get just wild and reckless.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:11.425
- I like your shoulders.

00:03:11.425 --> 00:03:12.524
Okay.
- But you know what I mean?

00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:14.010
That's how I want the crowd to be.

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:14.843
- They're getting groovy.

00:03:14.843 --> 00:03:16.870
I like it.
- Loose and loose.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:17.824
- You know what, though?

00:03:17.824 --> 00:03:18.657
It's kind of a stupid question

00:03:18.657 --> 00:03:20.440
cause everybody at this point is so dying

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.680
for like live music.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.290
Everyone's going to be having a good time.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.710
- Yeah, yeah.
- That's so cool.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.500
Have you ever had any mishaps on stage?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:27.520
Like where something...

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:28.720
I've had a few.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:30.423
- What did you have happen?
- No, we're good.

00:03:30.423 --> 00:03:31.630
- Just give me one.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:34.910
- I shared one and it made
like headline news everywhere.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.480
And I was like, "I don't
know if I wanted everyone

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.240
