- Right.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.870
- I was at Staples.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:44.080
One time and well, I got food poisoning

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:44.913
and well...

00:03:44.913 --> 00:03:45.950
