00:06:17.953 --> 00:06:20.220
I mean, I did a thing with Post Malone

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:21.810
for this Elvis tribute that we did.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.643
- I saw that.

00:06:22.643 --> 00:06:24.267
- And it was great.
- Oh, my God I love that.

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:25.506
Was Blake on that?

00:06:25.506 --> 00:06:26.339
- Yeah.

00:06:26.339 --> 00:06:28.290
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. I saw that. Yeah.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.670
- And I just love him so much.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.860
It was great to get to play with him.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.900
- Yeah, and it was
interesting to see all of...

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.467
I would've never guessed
all of y'all on a stage.

00:06:34.467 --> 00:06:36.430
It was like a really cool moment.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.263
I thought that was

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:38.120
really well done.
- Yeah, thank you.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.070
- Yeah. That's so cool to get to play

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:40.940
with a bunch of people.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.500
Is there anybody that you
really wanna play with

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.890
that you've never played with?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.260
- Oh, tons of people.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:46.230
We should sing a song.

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.513
- Fine.

00:06:47.513 --> 00:06:49.011
(audience cheers)

00:06:49.011 --> 00:06:50.062
I love singing.

00:06:50.062 --> 00:06:51.383
I love singing with you.

00:06:51.383 --> 00:06:52.770
- Just give me your number and
I won't call for a long time.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.950
- Okay, you won't call for a long time.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.780
No, but John Meyer said that you paid him

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:58.340
