00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.173
And I found out the way

00:06:59.173 --> 00:07:01.270
and I want you to tell
people because it's awesome.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.510
- Yeah. It was an amplifier
that I was gonna buy from him.

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:05.590
It's really expensive.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.360
Anyway, long story short.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.750
I had to figure out how
to get the money to him.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:13.190
He sent me the amp and so
I had a check written out.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:16.560
I put it in this crazy sort of briefcase.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:17.830
