00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:28.050
And then just walked off.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:28.940
- I didn't know that part.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.197
I thought you just gave it to him.

00:07:30.197 --> 00:07:31.718
You had someone come in and like-

00:07:31.718 --> 00:07:32.551
- I had someone.

00:07:32.551 --> 00:07:34.510
Yeah, it would never happen now.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.570
- Oh, my gosh. You're so funny.

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:39.890
You're all about the end game with a joke.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.790
That is like a serious follow through.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:44.170
That's amazing.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.860
You also performed recently with H.E.R

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.330
