00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:54.660
They called me and said "Can
you fill in for Bryan Adams?"

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.890
And I was like "Oh my gosh.
This is a tall order."

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.170
Cause Bryan's an amazing singer,

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.673
H.E.R is a great singer.

00:08:01.524 --> 00:08:02.410
- And so are you.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.097
- I wouldn't have minded a
little more rehearsal time

00:08:04.097 --> 00:08:06.077
but you just go for it.

00:08:06.077 --> 00:08:08.410
- But that's why I think
that you playing in clubs,

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:11.400
growing up I think that
you're that guy that they know

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:14.400
they can call to be like he
is so good at just adapting.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.390
I think that's why.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.950
They can't call anybody and do that.

